{
  "date": "2026-07-22",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "65c1ee156a",
      "text": "The damage is done.",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/31341.mp3",
      "translation": "覆水難收。",
      "author": "CK"
    },
    {
      "id": "3bfc1fff4e",
      "text": "You can buy whichever you like, but not both.",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/37989.mp3",
      "translation": "你喜欢哪个就买哪个,但不能两个都买。",
      "author": "CK"
    },
    {
      "id": "0067306ee7",
      "text": "I'll get in touch with Tom.",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/2544283.mp3",
      "translation": "我会跟汤姆联系。",
      "author": "CK"
    },
    {
      "id": "f021c5ebfe",
      "text": "She looked me in the eye.",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/314390.mp3",
      "translation": "她看着我的眼睛。",
      "author": "CK"
    },
    {
      "id": "506b1a8130",
      "text": "You haven't changed at all.",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/16420.mp3",
      "translation": "你一点都没变。",
      "author": "CK"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2693ed6b5",
      "text": "Guns don't kill people. People kill people.",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/483350.mp3",
      "translation": "槍不會殺人。人才會殺人。",
      "author": "papabear"
    },
    {
      "id": "11bf304ca1",
      "text": "I can't stand this noise any longer.",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/58022.mp3",
      "translation": "我無法再忍受這個噪音了。",
      "author": "CK"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7f7f94025",
      "text": "He really likes music a lot.",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/1316128.mp3",
      "translation": "他真的很热爱音乐。",
      "author": "CK"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ea071f6e7",
      "text": "Did you decide to go to Japan?",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/1812967.mp3",
      "translation": "你决定去日本了吗？",
      "author": "CK"
    },
    {
      "id": "2c5ccabfe0",
      "text": "I knew I was going to win.",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/5217982.mp3",
      "translation": "我知道我会赢。",
      "author": "CK"
    },
    {
      "id": "6e59583edd",
      "text": "We didn't know what train they'd be on.",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/304948.mp3",
      "translation": "我們不知道他們會乘哪一班列車。",
      "author": "CK"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e669d777e",
      "text": "Who is your favourite singer?",
      "audio": "https://audio.tatoeba.org/sentences/eng/5241605.mp3",
      "translation": "你喜欢的歌手是谁？",
      "author": "dcampbell"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "page 1: 累计 9 条",
    "page 2: 累计 12 条"
  ]
}